== Trivia ==
* Greed has his own [https://twitter.com/iamisaacsbody account on Twitter.] This was uncovered after the community dug up a [https://imgur.com/V2l5TaN figurine] of Greed covered in Sharpie marks during an [[Keeper_ARG|ARG]], which quickly led to his account. After guessing his password, and tweeting on it, the password was quickly changed and was then used to announce the arrival of {{C|Keeper}}.
* The [[wikipedia:Seven Deadly Sins|Seven Deadly Sins]] that these mini-bosses are based upon are, in Christian teachings, a classification of vices from which all others are derived.
* Greed is a personification of one of the Seven Deadly Sins, with Greed being described as an inordinate desire to possess something, whether that be wealth, power, etc. Greed is a desire to possess something even if it means doing something immoral. Greed can lead to sins such as deception, violence, hardheartedness, and ingratitude.

